IMHO, Stormbringer does not have enough of a character of its own.
Here's a few suggestions:

Stormbringer is a "Chaotic" weapon in the sense that, if you
wield it, you don't get asked before hitting friendly/tame creatures.
(You go "berserk", as in Omega.) To offset this, we give it a
few advantages, such as more HP damage than Excalibur and all
the other features that Excalibur has.  To make it even more
interesting, maybe Stormbringer could be sticky-cursed, ala
loadstones.

